@startuml
title Valetax Support Ticket Co-Pilot - Component View
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Support Agent\nHuman Reviewer" as Agent
cloud "Approved Valetax Pages" as Pages <<untrusted external content>>
cloud "Optional Live LLM" as LiveLLM <<external trust boundary>>

package "Trusted Local Application Boundary" {
  [CLI] as CLI <<implemented>>
  [Application Orchestrator] as App <<planned>>
  [Input Validator] as Input <<partially implemented>>
  [Pre-generation Policy Gate] as PrePolicy <<implemented trading/KYC/complaint slices>>
  [Category Classifier] as Classifier <<partially implemented>>
  [Section Retriever] as Retriever <<implemented for synthetic snapshot>>
  [Evidence Validator] as Evidence <<implemented timelines and explicit conflicts>>
  [Drafting Service] as Draft <<implemented extractive deposit>>
  [Post-generation Safety Gate] as PostPolicy <<planned>>
  [Human Router] as Router <<implemented coverage/safety/confidence slices>>
  [Result Validator] as Result <<implemented audit aggregate; CLI partial>>
  [Provider Protocol] as Provider <<planned>>
  [Deterministic Offline Adapter] as Offline <<planned>>
  database "Versioned KB Snapshots" as Snapshot <<implemented synthetic fixture>>
  database "Redacted Audit Metrics" as Audit <<planned>>
}

Agent --> CLI : ticket / review
CLI --> App
App --> Input --> PrePolicy --> Classifier
Classifier --> Retriever --> Evidence --> Draft --> PostPolicy --> Router --> Result
Retriever --> Snapshot
Provider <|.. Offline
Provider <|.. LiveLLM
Classifier --> Provider
Draft --> Provider
Result --> CLI : validated JSON
Result --> Audit : metadata only
Pages --> Snapshot : allowlisted snapshot ingestion
Router --> Agent : draft, abstention, or escalation

note right of CLI
No automatic customer transmission.
end note

note bottom of PrePolicy
Ticket text and retrieved text are untrusted data.
Deterministic gates enforce critical policy.
end note
@enduml
